OL,3,GNEWSAFamily caught up in anti-migrant
OL,4,Aprotest 'felt unsafe'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who was stuck on a yacht in a
OL,7,Fmarina targeted by anti-migrant
OL,8,Fprotesters has said he and his family
OL,9,Ffelt "completely unsafe".
OL,11,FOn Sunday, police faced off with
OL,12,Fdemonstrators as they blocked roads in
OL,13,FPortsmouth in an effort to stop 140
OL,14,Fpeople from leaving the city who
OL,15,Farrived at the Eastney Landing ferry
OL,16,Fport area.
OL,18,FToby Merritt-Smith, who found himself
OL,19,Fstuck on his yacht as the marina went
OL,20,Finto lockdown during the evening, said
OL,21,Fsome people had come to the area "for a
OL,22,Ffight".
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
